    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gambetto combines Rogue-Like Deck Building and the rules of chess to create a challenging, turn-based strategy card game.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Big-Brain Combat!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront adversaries on a 5x5 chess board, and leverage your wit with careful placements, timed movements, and varied card synergies. Claim your foe\u2019s king to win the round and dramatically improve your deck with hundreds of randomized rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672840/extras/07023f64b87a4a76b912362fc986b03c.poster.avif?t=1749286213\" width=800 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672840/extras/07023f64b87a4a76b912362fc986b03c.webm?t=1749286213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672840/extras/07023f64b87a4a76b912362fc986b03c.mp4?t=1749286213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Improve Your Deck!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter hidden shops and unlock rewards to add powerful cards to your deck. Each king has a unique, character-based card pool, further enhanced with other card effects and synergies. Craft the strongest deck with your imagination and creativity. Endless possibilities await!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672840/extras/f8bcff39ca9db676e9e6709b43da09c0.poster.avif?t=1749286213\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672840/extras/f8bcff39ca9db676e9e6709b43da09c0.webm?t=1749286213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672840/extras/f8bcff39ca9db676e9e6709b43da09c0.mp4?t=1749286213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >... And much much more!!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gambetto is still under development, and upcoming features include:\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete runs or finish special achievements to unlock new cards and terrific factions.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover puzzling challenges with difficulty modifiers for the boldest, smartest challengers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mod compatibility, so you can make your creativity shine.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gambetto combines Rogue-Like Deck Building and the rules of chess to create a challenging, turn-based strategy card game.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Big-Brain Combat!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront adversaries on a 5x5 chess board, and leverage your wit with careful placements, timed movements, and varied card synergies. Claim your foe\u2019s king to win the round and dramatically improve your deck with hundreds of randomized rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672840/extras/07023f64b87a4a76b912362fc986b03c.poster.avif?t=1749286213\" width=800 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672840/extras/07023f64b87a4a76b912362fc986b03c.webm?t=1749286213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672840/extras/07023f64b87a4a76b912362fc986b03c.mp4?t=1749286213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Improve Your Deck!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter hidden shops and unlock rewards to add powerful cards to your deck. Each king has a unique, character-based card pool, further enhanced with other card effects and synergies. Craft the strongest deck with your imagination and creativity. Endless possibilities await!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672840/extras/f8bcff39ca9db676e9e6709b43da09c0.poster.avif?t=1749286213\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672840/extras/f8bcff39ca9db676e9e6709b43da09c0.webm?t=1749286213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672840/extras/f8bcff39ca9db676e9e6709b43da09c0.mp4?t=1749286213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >... And much much more!!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gambetto is still under development, and upcoming features include:\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete runs or finish special achievements to unlock new cards and terrific factions.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover puzzling challenges with difficulty modifiers for the boldest, smartest challengers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mod compatibility, so you can make your creativity shine.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "The chess-inspired card roguelike. Gambetto is a strategic deckbuilder where you cast cards on a board to combat monstrous enemies, capture formidable kings, and improve your deck!",
